    "review_summary": [
      "Scope audit: the exact 65-file manifest SHA matches and every current file hash equals its frozen value. Canonical config remains the specified 9 variants / 21 bindings; the evidence covers 96 flattened action routes and 156 source blocks.",
      "Tiers and lifecycle: the nine actual own I–IV tier tables provide .05/.055/.06/.065 generic power modifier per effective layer. The matching child conditional override replaces the .01 base fallback; it is not added on top. Eight variants use 3.5 seconds and shotgun_p2 uses 5 seconds. Five effective layers are the cap. Accepted kills add one and refresh the shared timer even at cap; expiry clears the effective layers together on the relevant fixed update. Switching suppresses the held-slot stat but does not pause the timer; true removal cleans the parent and child.",
      "Trigger boundary: a died result is required, with attack_type=ranged or explicit count_as_ranged_attack, exact source item, held slot, and hit distance <=12.5m. This predicate has no Terrifying Barrage-style explosion allowance. The delayed P1 fire and P4 M1 stun ticks use buff attacks without ranged opt-in; P4 M2 applies a rending state without damage ticks.",
      "Shotgun P2 special: actual bound modes include a special windup/setup followed by melee/push sweeps, not a special-projectile attack route. Those attacks do not trigger this ranged-close kill effect; an already active generic power modifier can still contribute when a held attack consumes that power input.",
      "First effect and formula: the lethal hit resolves before on_kill is delivered and before the new child stack/stat cache is available. With B measured after its native power-type curve and before generic pooled modifiers, P=B*(1+q+n*p). Tier IV at n=5, B=100, q=0 gives 132.5. At q=.20, input 120 becomes 152.5: +32.5 power input or 27.08% relative to 120. Neither example claims the same final health damage percentage.",
      "RAW comparison: the paired description uses hash fe798d47. English says “Close Range Kill”; the paired Traditional Chinese RAW says “近戰攻擊擊殺後”. The formal erratum correctly flags that as a melee-trigger wording contradiction and clarifies “近距離擊殺”; omitted range/item/lifecycle details remain documentation gaps.",
      "UI delta: the bound Heavy Stubber P1 m3 UI name is reconstructed from actual family, pattern and Mark fields as “雙鏈重型機槍 阿克利斯 Mk VII” / “Twin-Linked Heavy Stubber Achlys Mk VII”. The old single-key RAW quote “阿克利斯MK V二聯重機槍” and English “Achlys Mk VII Twin-Linked Heavy Stubber” remain explicitly preserved; only UI mark name/name_en/name_keys changed in the delta.",
      "Presentation and associations: all 15 own formal pages, source index, compatibility pages, shared map/global/reverse references and the scoped related pages agree with the exact binding and UI evidence. The icon receipt matches the formal image URL and records 128x128, public HTTP 200, hash and display verification. Focused source/link/GFM receipts report 344 ranges / 110 files, 0 new link errors, 36 Markdown files, and verified global partition/previous objects."
